{
  "source": "../api/zipNativeObjectType.md",
  "modules": [
    {
      "textRaw": "ZipNativeObject",
      "name": "zipnativeobject",
      "desc": "<p>ZipNativeObject 是 <code>zip.open</code>, <code>zipFile</code>, <code>zipDir</code>, <code>zipFiles</code>, <code>unzip</code> 等入口返回的 ZIP 操作对象.</p>\n<p>源码依据:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>app/src/main/java/org/autojs/autojs/runtime/api/augment/zip/Zip.kt</code></li>\n<li><code>app/src/main/java/org/autojs/autojs/runtime/api/augment/zip/ZipNativeObject.kt</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p>常见相关方法或属性:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"zip#m-open\">zip.open</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"zip#m-zipfile\">zip.zipFile</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"zip#m-zipdir\">zip.zipDir</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"zip#m-zipfiles\">zip.zipFiles</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"zip#m-unzip\">zip.unzip</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"zipOptionsType\">ZipOptions</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font: bold 2em sans-serif; color: #FF7043\">ZipNativeObject</p>\n\n<hr>\n<p><code>ZipNativeObject</code> 构造时会解析 ZIP 路径、校验选项对象、创建底层 <code>net.lingala.zip4j.ZipFile</code>, 并构造 <code>zipParameters</code> / <code>unzipParameters</code>. 构造失败或压缩 / 解压入口操作失败时, 源码会尝试关闭底层 <code>ZipFile</code> 后再抛出异常.</p>\n",
      "modules": [
        {
          "textRaw": "[p] name",
          "name": "[p]_name",
          "desc": "<ul>\n<li>{ <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>创建对象的操作名, 如 <code>open</code> / <code>zipFile</code> / <code>unzip</code>.</p>\n",
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[p] name"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[p] path",
          "name": "[p]_path",
          "desc": "<ul>\n<li>{ <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>ZIP 文件的运行时解析路径.</p>\n",
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[p] path"
        },
        {
