          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[p] zipFile"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[p] options",
          "name": "[p]_options",
          "desc": "<ul>\n<li>{ <a href=\"dataTypes#object\">object</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>原始选项对象. 空选项会被转换为空 JavaScript 对象.</p>\n",
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[p] options"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[p] zipParameters",
          "name": "[p]_zipparameters",
          "desc": "<ul>\n<li>{ <a href=\"https://javadoc.io/doc/net.lingala.zip4j/zip4j/latest/net/lingala/zip4j/model/ZipParameters.html\">net.lingala.zip4j.model.ZipParameters</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>由 <a href=\"zipOptionsType\">ZipOptions</a> 构造出的压缩参数.</p>\n",
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[p] zipParameters"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[p] unzipParameters",
          "name": "[p]_unzipparameters",
          "desc": "<ul>\n<li>{ <a href=\"https://javadoc.io/doc/net.lingala.zip4j/zip4j/latest/net/lingala/zip4j/model/UnzipParameters.html\">net.lingala.zip4j.model.UnzipParameters</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>由 <a href=\"zipOptionsType\">ZipOptions</a> 构造出的解压参数.</p>\n",
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[p] unzipParameters"
        },
